### User Service - Logout
### Requires Authorization Bearer token
### After logout, the access token will be blacklisted and cannot be used

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@apiVersion = /api/v1
@contentType = application/json
@accessToken = {{accessToken}}

### Logout - Blacklists the current access token
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "Logout failed");
    client.log("Logout successful. Access token has been blacklisted.");
    client.log("Try using the token again - it should be rejected.");
%}

### Test: Try to use token after logout (should fail with 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
    client.assert(response.status === 401, "Token should be rejected after logout");
    client.log("Token correctly rejected after logout - blacklisting works!");
%}